        "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/8152f13b5ddd1c62befc5cdb27fafb60.avif?t=1756225465\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.poster.avif?t=1756225465\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.webm?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.mp4?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.poster.avif?t=1756225465\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.webm?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.mp4?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50-90 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail on the first 8 floors and progress will reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass 8th floor and your progress will be locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go down to ground floor to unlock the anomaly museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go underground to unlock all the anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.poster.avif?t=1756225465\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.webm?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/c02f5bfbfb3dcc207fddc12d27bc9e3d.mp4?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.poster.avif?t=1756225465\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.webm?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/1b502a7ce93e5c8fe40eb3f05707aa7d.mp4?t=1756225465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50-90 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail on the first 8 floors and progress will reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass 8th floor and your progress will be locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go down to ground floor to unlock the anomaly museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go underground to unlock all the anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
